[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2402.589, "timestamp": "00:40:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2405.349, "timestamp": "00:40:05", "text": "呃，我真的很想和你联系。我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2407.349, "timestamp": "00:40:07", "text": "了解更多平台信息。我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2410.87, "timestamp": "00:40:10", "text": "在这里，尽力做好事。但问题是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2414.349, "timestamp": "00:40:14", "text": "必须和认识的人一起去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2417.589, "timestamp": "00:40:17", "text": "英语。就是这样。将会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2421.99, "timestamp": "00:40:21", "text": "难的。所以我的想法是，要么我尝试"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2424.47, "timestamp": "00:40:24", "text": "联系一下或许会有帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2425.71, "timestamp": "00:40:25", "text": "可能不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2430.23, "timestamp": "00:40:30", "text": "工作。嗯，这是克洛诺斯的儿子克洛诺，他是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2435.19, "timestamp": "00:40:35", "text": "帮我处理了一些事情的那个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2438.79, "timestamp": "00:40:38", "text": "当时我正在上传我的 YouTube 视频，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2441.19, "timestamp": "00:40:41", "text": "Twitch Vaults 转至 Billy Billy。我曾"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2444.15, "timestamp": "00:40:44", "text": "注意到有些直播流出现了问题。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2444.22, "timestamp": "00:40:44", "author": "@AKSHAY-qt8oj", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ZwKRpaq_Ug9LghG0R1lyE02nZuJA8_EGcBDRKCwLPHhmICNVxR-3VtAEjcOtxBq32OfpsfSX=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "im a lurker so dont mind me lurking here ~ "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2447.67, "timestamp": "00:40:47", "text": "已撤下。 Apex被关闭等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2451.67, "timestamp": "00:40:51", "text": "暴力游戏等等。但他很善良……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2457.79, "timestamp": "00:40:57", "text": "他对我很好。我们聊了一会儿。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2458.795, "timestamp": "00:40:58", "author": "@Anti-SpiritArt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/wYaIbwf481rN5bfgaxWnbUoh-faRynKzhqgZXK5WIvlx9DlMJJl0M6boNmqYw